{"path":"iterator/istreambuf_iterator/equal","title":"std::istreambuf_iterator<CharT,Traits>::equal","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::istreambuf_iterator&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>equal","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/iterator/istreambuf_iterator/equal","section":"iterator","kind":"page","summary":"Checks whether both *this and it are valid, or both are invalid, regardless of the stream buffer objects they use.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> equal<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> istreambuf_iterator<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> it <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Checks whether both <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">it</span></code> are valid, or both are invalid, regardless of the stream buffer objects they use.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> it\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> another stream buffer iterator to compare to\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if both <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">it</span></code> are valid, or both are invalid, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> otherwise.\